The main macro in this section is 


suite.mac                      ! Switches to diffev and starts re refinement



DIFFEV Macros in this directory are:


ref.ex0.diffev.mac             ! Macro to refine a disordered structure

DISCUS Macros in this directory are:

ref.ex0.diffev_setup.mac       ! Main discus macro started by diffev
ref.ex0.diffev_continue.mac    ! Coninue an interrupted refinement

ref.ex0.dis.diffev.mac         ! Principal discus macro started by diffev
ref.ex0.discus.main.mac        ! Main discus tasks are done here
ref.ex0.sort.mac               ! Sort the structure
ref.ex0.fourier.mac            ! Calculates the Fourier


KUPLOT Macros in this directory are:

kpara.mac                      ! Plots the parameters versus generation number
kpar_par.mac                   ! Plots the parameter correlations
ksingle.mac                    ! Plots obs, calc for a member


ref.ex0.kup.diffev.mac         ! Principal kuplot macro started by diffev
ref.ex0.kup.select.mac         ! Just for book keeping of best results
ref.ex0.kup.backup.mac         ! Just for book keeping of best results
